cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "tinyinfer: an LLM inference engine from scratch in C11"
abstract: "A dependency-free C11 inference engine for Qwen2 GGUF models with Q8_0/Q4_0 quantisation, NEON/AVX2 kernels and a Metal backend, tested against a NumPy reference."
authors:
  - name: "the tinyinfer authors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/coopersimpson101-debug/tinyinfer"
keywords:
  - llm
  - inference
  - gguf
  - quantization
  - simd
  - metal
